<div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
<h3 itemprop="name">When will the Boox Picco be released?</h3>
<div itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
<div itemprop="text">
<p>Onyx Boox showed the Picco at IFA Berlin in early September 2026 and described the release window as "the next few months." A late 2026 or early 2027 ship date is the most likely scenario, consistent with the company's typical 2-4 month gap between IFA reveal and retail availability.</p>
</div>
</div>
