<div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
<h3 itemprop="name">How much will the Boox Picco cost?</h3>
<div itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
<div itemprop="text">
<p>Onyx confirmed at IFA Berlin that the Picco will retail for approximately $100 USD. This is at the low end of the $99-$129 range the company teased in July 2026 and positions the Picco as the cheapest Boox reader ever shipped.</p>
</div>
</div>
